      {
        "number": 54,
        "page": 14,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "A uniform rod is fixed at its midpoint on a fulcrum. When two equal forces are applied on the\nrod then the diagram that represents the equilibrium position is\nA\nB\nC\nD",
