      },
      {
        "number": 55,
        "page": 14,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "By adding two vectors P and Q, the CORRECT representation of the resultant R is\nA\nB\nC\nD\nR\nQ\nP\nR\nQ\nP\nQ\nR\nP\nQ\nR\nP",
