      },
      {
        "number": 57,
        "page": 15,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "Which of the following pieces of ticker tape shows that the object is speeding up its motion?\n(Note: Suppose that the left hand side of the ticker tape shows the initial point of the tape.)",
