        "diagram": null
      },
      {
        "number": 62,
        "page": 16,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "The distance between two consecutive antinodes of an incident wave is 1 m.\nIf the frequency of the wave is 25 Hz, then the velocity of the wave will be",
