        "diagram": null
      },
      {
        "number": 63,
        "page": 16,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "In an experiment of measuring the mechanical equivalent of heat, a stirrer is placed in the\ncalorimetre filled with hot water.\nAfter some time, the exposed end of the stirrer becomes hot.\nThe process(es) that is/ are mainly involved in the transferring of heat processes is/ are\nI.\nradiation\nII.\nconvection\nIII.\nconduction",
