        },
        "facsimile": "/paper-crops/PHY-XI-2022-P1/q63.png",
        "diagram": null
      },
      {
        "number": 64,
        "page": 16,
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "A student touches the metal surface of a hot calorimetre. He is likely to burn his hand.\nIf he holds his hand in the hot air inside the calorimetre, then he will remain fine.\nWhich of the following statements BEST describe the given condition?",
